            "title": "Consultation Statement Drafting",
            "description": "Draft a reasoned consultation statement (lausunto) on a Finnish legislative proposal from any respondent's perspective — municipality, agency, association or company: analyze the bill, assess impacts on the respondent, review other statements, and write a structured, well-argued response.",
            "type": "assistant",
