            "description": "Navigate Finnish consumer dispute resolution channels and good debt collection practice: complaints to the Consumer Disputes Board (Act 8/2007), consumer advisory services, and the lawfulness of collecting consumer receivables under the Debt Collection Act (513/1999), including collection costs and payment demands.",
