            "title": "MSA Draft",
            "description": "Drafts a provider-side Master Services Agreement or Customer Agreement from the bundled DOCX template for SaaS and SaaS-plus-professional-services deals. Use when the user asks to draft, prepare, set up, or customize an MSA, customer agreement, SaaS-plus-services agreement, or reusable house form, including order-form or SOW shells contained in the template. Do not use to review counterparty paper or negotiate an existing agreement; use an appropriate MSA-review workflow for those tasks.",
