            "description": "Assess agreements, cooperation, and unilateral conduct under Finnish and EU competition law (Competition Act 948/2011, TFEU Articles 101 and 102): cartels, information exchange, vertical restraints, abuse of dominance, sanctions, leniency, and damages.",
            "type": "assistant",
